## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-kernel RR tick
function timerTick(running, ready) {
  running.quantum--;
  if (running.quantum <= 0) {
    ready.enqueue(running);
    const next = ready.dequeue();
    contextSwitch(running, next);
  }
}
```

